<title>USA: SyQuest names chief financial officer.</title>
<headline>SyQuest names chief financial officer.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>SyQuest Technology Inc said Tuesday it has appointed Bob Corey as its chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Corey, 45, succeeds Henry Montgomery, who has left the company to return to Montgomery Financial Services Corp.</p>
<p>Corey joins SyQuest from Primavera, where he was chief financial officer. His prior experience includes chief financial officer positions with MTI Technology Corp and Emulex Corp.</p>
</text>
